        "locator": "pdf-page:6;normalized-utf16:1129:2841",
        "quote": "V. APPLICATION MATERIALS (* IS REQUIRED) *(1) The Photocopy of Passport (Photo Page) and China Visa Page (If you have) *(2) The Certified/Notarized Copy of High School Transcripts (Chinese or English version ) *(3) The Certified/Notarized Copy of High School Diploma (Chinese or English version ) *(4) The Valid Report of Chinese or English Language Proficiency Tests. (For Chinese Medium: HSK5≥180, For English Medium: IELTS≥6.0/ TOEFL≥85/ Duolingo≥110 or other language certificate recognized by BIT. English native speakers are exempted) *(5) China Scholastic competency Assessment (CSCA) transcript (Those who have not yet obtained the transcript shall provide proof of exam registration. The official CSCA transcript must be uploaded prior to the issuance of the pre-admission notice. Official CSCA website: www.csca.cn). *(6) Personal Statement/Study Plan (Download BIT International Student Personal Statement Template from https://isc.bit.edu.cn/→Resources→Download, and upload it in the application system after filling out) *(7) A video of self introduction (8) Scholarship Application Form (For scholarship applicants) (9) Applications under 18 must upload all materials required in Application Materials for Student under 18 from “Download” Zone shown above (10) Physical Examination Record for Foreigner (please go to hospital for a physical examination as required in Physical Examination Record for Foreigner from “Download” zone shown above and upload it in the application system) (11) Financial Guarantee Letter (The certificate of bank saving) (12) Non-criminal Record (Issued by the local police station) (13) Other documents (Students in design major should provide no less than 2 art works)",
